    ∫ x : Mx D t A.rank, (dblDec A).mixS T ψ ν 𝓨 (heisO ψ (dblSp A) T ((dblDec A).extX T (d.j0 ⬝ a)) φ) (d.jX ⬝ x) 0 ∂μ₂ at h
